                "loc": "ZEP.2.4+ZEP.2.5+ZEP.2.6+ZEP.2.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zef 2.4-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abanyashikeloni bazabireba batinye, n'ab'i Gaza bazababara cyane, n'aba Ekuroni ibyo bari biringiye bizabahemukira, kandi i Gaza hazabura umwami, na Ashikeloni abantu bazahashira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibibyarwa ni byo bizatura Ashidodi, kandi Abafilisitiya nzabaca ku bwibone bwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzamukura amaraso mu kanwa, nzamukura n'ibizira mu menyo. Azaba asigaye arokotse abe uw'Imana, azaba nk'umutware w'u Buyuda kandi Ekuroni hazaba nk'Umuyebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inzu yanjye nzayigotesha urugerero ruhangane n'ingabo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", kugira ngo hatagira unyuraho agenda cyangwa agaruka. Nta muntu urenganya uzongera kubanyura hagati, kuko noneho mbyiboneye n'amaso yanjye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
