          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.24.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuva 24.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi nawe ku bw'isezerano ryawe rihamywa n'amaraso, nanjye nkubohoreye imbohe, nzikura mu rwobo rutagira amazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimuhindukirire igihome gikomeye, mwa mbohe zifite ibyiringiro mwe. Uyu munsi ndahamya yuko nzabashumbusha kabiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko mfoye Yuda nk'umuheto na Efurayimu akamubera umwambi, kandi abahungu bawe Siyoni, nzabateza abahungu b'i Bugiriki, nzakugira inkota y'intwari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Uwiteka azahasesekara agaragare hejuru yabo, umwambi we uzagenda nk'umurabyo kandi Umwami Imana izavuza ihembe, ijyane na serwakira y'ikusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka Nyiringabo azabarinda, bazatsemba ababisha bakandagire ku mabuye y'imihumetso. Bazanywa basahinde nk'abanywi ba vino, buzure nk'uko inzabya zo ku nkokora z'igicaniro zuzura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze uwo munsi Uwiteka Imana yabo izabakiza nk'ukiza umukumbi w'abantu be, bazamera nk'amabuye meza atatse ku ikamba ashyizwe hejuru y'igihugu cye. ",
          "type": "text",
